      <activity id="a7b63a11-abd8-59d0-8961-a06381729cea" activityNameId="7068ba6d-dc95-51f9-9737-0ad946729ba6" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Oil power plant 500MW</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Oil power plant 500MW
Infrastructure with a life time of 30 years, 65% employment and 38% efficiency.;
UUID: db03cd10-207e-34de-b2fd-9d3aacf6dabd
Infrastructure of a power plant with 500MW including materials, energy use for construction, disposal and land use.
Location: Estimation for Europe.
Technology: Material split derived from a 800Mw plant in the US with electrostatic particle filter, desulphurisation unit, effluent treatment, sludge dewatering and waste management.
Time period: Data based on old literature data. Material use might be underestimated due to new flue gas treatment facilities.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature. 
Extrapolations: Some data of a coal power plant have been used for comparison.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_db03cd10-207e-34de-b2fd-9d3aacf6dabd.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="20a9bf48-6cea-59b4-ad08-000cb981f2d0" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
